  "solution": "The logic followed here is:\n\nLet G and H be '+'\n\nLet I be '÷'\n\nSo,\n\n8 G 4 H 9 I 3 = 15 ⇒ 8 + 4 + 9 ÷ 3 = 15\n\n⇒ 8 + 4 + __**9 ÷**____** 3**__ = 15\n\n⇒ __**8 + 4 + **____**3**__ = 15\n\n⇒ 15 = 15 (LHS = RHS)\n\nAnd,\n\n17 G 18 H 27 I 9 = 38 ⇒ 17 + 18 + 27 ÷ 9 = 38\n\n⇒ 17 + 18 + __**27 ÷**____** 9**__ = 38\n\n⇒ __**17 + 18 + 3**__ = 38\n\n⇒ 38 = 38 (LHS = RHS)\n\nSimilarly,\n\n7 G 8 H 10 I 2 = ? ⇒ 7 + 8 + 10 ÷ 2 = ?\n\n⇒ 7 + 8 + __**10 **____**÷**____** 2**__ = ?\n\n⇒ __**7 + 8 + 5**__ = ?\n\n⇒ **20**** = ?**\n\nHence, **\"Option 3\"** is the correct answer.",
